<title>GERMANY: Buba revises German Nov industry orders down. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Buba revises German Nov industry orders down. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS	 Nov 96	   Oct 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.6	     +2.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +2.5	     +6.4</p>
<p>(Corrects yr-on-yr figure for October from +3.6 to +6.4.)</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    98.0 (99.1)    98.6</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.7	     +3.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.5	     +7.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    96.7 (97.7)    97.4 (97.5)</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +4.4	    -3.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -22.6	   -11.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   131.2 (132.7)  125.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
